{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Suyāmana","html":"<article id='thag1.74'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.74 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.74 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Aṭṭhamavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Eight </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Suyāmanattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Suyāmana </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Kāmacchando ca byāpādo, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Sensual desire, ill will, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Thinamiddhañca bhikkhuno; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>dullness and drowsiness, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Uddhaccaṁ vicikicchā ca, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>restlessness, and doubt </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Sabbasova na vijjatī”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>are not found in a monk at all. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Suyāmano thero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
